# A quick add goes after the project's last child but before a trailing special node, which stays last.
file <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Old item
	LOG @hidden @log
		[2026-10-04 12:09] Started
Work:
END
keys q
type New item
keys <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Old item
	- New item
	LOG @hidden @log
		[2026-10-04 12:09] Started
Work:
END
